Z||000004||bya72||06-07-2001||02:00 PM||||Someone started a post about Fieros on another message board I frequent, Jeepsunlimited.com.  Some one started trashing you guys and how you felt about the cars.  Funny thing is, we are the same way about our Jeeps.  I still go to the other board more often than here, but it is getting to be a close race.  Everything I have left to buy for the jeep are big ticket items.  The Fiero, on the otherhand, still needs work.  It was bought for awork car, but the addiction is catching on.  In the process of getting both headlight motors to work.  Next,  I try to repaint.  I don't know why my friends all shake there heads when I tell them I am going to do it myself.  I couldn't look that much worse.||||reg||1
Z||000005||TRiAD||06-07-2001||02:32 PM||||Wow, there a few of us, eh?<BR>I did a search for Fiero links, and found the "Fiero world links" page, which had this forum on it. <BR>Now it's in my favorites, but if you go to Yahoo and just search on "Fiero Forum", this is the first hit.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>We gotta get together at the El Paso show!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> ||||reg||1
